[[Brian Eno]] and [[Peter Schmidt]]

A way to unstick yourself in a creative endeavor.

Eno and Schmidt collected their own personal prompts into a shared card deck. Basically verby, action prompts to get you to do something new or different or just SOMETHING when you were unsure where a creative work should go next or were feeling uninspired or just plain stuck.

I built my own virtual deck here: https://oblique.ookb.co/